---
title: "rls_policy_teams (0000_create_member_schema)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_role: evaluate request role
    q_check_role --> q_service_all: role = service_role
    q_check_role --> q_auth_check: role = authenticated
    q_check_role --> q_deny: role = anon or other

    q_service_all --> q_allow: USING(true) WITH CHECK(true) -- all operations
    q_auth_check --> q_check_op: check operation type
    q_check_op --> q_allow_read: operation = SELECT -- USING(true)
    q_check_op --> q_deny: operation = INSERT, UPDATE, or DELETE

    q_allow_read --> q_allow: return rows
    q_allow --> [*]: access granted
    q_deny --> [*]: access denied

    note right of q_check_role
        INV-001: service_role has unrestricted access
        INV-002: authenticated users can only SELECT (read-only)
        INV-003: No INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE policies for authenticated on teams
        INV-004: anon role has NO access
    end note
